{"usage":"node scripts/harness-research.mjs research start|next|peek|submit|source|heartbeat|release|status|retry|continue|block|reassess|verify|approve|refresh --project DIR [options] [--verbose]; research find --in DIR [--query TEXT]","note":"The harness does the research; this helper manages durable tasks and evidence. Start requires --topic, or --from PATH to begin from earlier research; all writes after start bind the current --run. Task writes require --task --worker --lease --attempt. next writes the full task to the file it names; --verbose prints full JSON. reassess --again ID,... [--reason TEXT] researches chosen questions again. verify reads --keys FILE (or --key KEY) and reports what became of each cited fact. approve --by NAME [--revision N] records an approval. refresh re-reads the web sources of a finished run."}
